{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SolAttention","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inputs must have the same contiguous rank-4 NHWC "},{"code":"[N, T, H, D]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" shape. Output"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retains that shape and separate heads; no layout conversion is implicit."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"approximationRange","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is half-open and applies to both Q and KV. Only query"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"groups and KV blocks wholly within the range may use summaries; protected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and boundary-crossing interactions remain token-level. "},{"code":"localBlockRadius","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"must be at least one and keeps neighboring KV blocks exact.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"scale","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"tau","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must be finite. Zero and negative scales are supported;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"tau = 0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not request dense attention. Use "},{"code":"ScaledDotProductAttention","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for dense attention."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"CPU supports FP32 and general positive head, block, and query dimensions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"MPS requires FP16, D=128, block\/query sizes in {16, 32, 64}, and query size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no larger than KV block size. MPS selects INT8 on neural-accelerator hardware","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and floating-point SIMD otherwise. ","type":"text"},{"code":".disableMFANeuralAccelerators","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" selects","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the latter; it is distinct from ","type":"text"},{"code":".disableMFAAppleNeuralEngine","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (ANE).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CUDA, backward, causal\/masked attention, GQA, unequal-length cross-attention,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and noncontiguous inputs are unsupported. There is no fallback to another op."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/Model"],"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom"},{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/AnyModel"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/SolAttention","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SolAttention"}],"externalID":"s:3NNC12SolAttentionC","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SolAttention"}],"roleHeading":"Class","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","modules":[{"name":"NNC"}],"title":"SolAttention"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Forward-only, parameter-free Sol approximate attention with exactly three inputs: Q, K, V."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/SolAttention\/init(scale:tau:approximationRange:blockSize:queryBlockSize:localBlockRadius:name:)"],"title":"Ini